  "unreadable": [],
  "notes": "Label = GPIO name; CircuitPython name first in functions, then outward. Screw terminal order from callout lines: VO+, VO-, EXTERNAL_BUTTON, V+, GND, EXTERNAL_NEOPIXELS (left to right). VO+/VO- read as letter O (round glyph matching the O in BUTTON). Servo header silkscreen Sig/V+/G; Sig wire (blue) to EXTERNAL_SERVO, V+ (red) and G to the V+/GND callouts. I2S amp, accelerometer and external-power control signals are internal; skipped. D4-labelled NeoPixel callout points at the on-board LED and BUTTON at the on-board button; skipped. Tiny silkscreen on the rendered PCB not transcribed."
